 ## Key Capabilities
+
+- **Build and traverse 3D scene graphs.** Build and traverse 3D scene graphs using `Scene`, `Node`, and `Entity` classes, attaching geometry through `Node.addEntity` or `Node.createChildNode` and organizing nodes into a parent-child hierarchy.
+- **Import and export STL geometry.** Import and export STL geometry in binary or ASCII format using `StlLoadOptions` and `StlSaveOptions`, dispatched through `Scene.fromFile` and `Scene.save`, with the `.stl` format fully functional end to end.
+- **Define materials and assign them to nodes.** Define materials with `LambertMaterial`, `PhongMaterial`, and `PbrMaterial` classes supporting albedo, metallic/roughness, occlusion, and emissive channels plus texture references, and assign them per node via `Node.setMaterial`.
+- **Model NURBS curves with control points.** Model NURBS curves using `NurbsCurve`, exposing control points, knot vectors, and degree/order data.
+- **Perform 3D math operations.** Perform 3D math operations using `Vector2`, `Vector3`, `Vector4`, `Matrix4`, `Quaternion`, and `BoundingBox` classes that underlie every scene operation.
+- **Detect file format automatically.** Detect file format automatically or resolve an explicit format from a file path or binary stream using `FileFormat.detect` and `FileFormat.getFormatByExtension`.
 
